{
  "name": "FraudNova WooCommerce order risk to Telegram",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### How it works\nScreens every new WooCommerce order with FraudNova and alerts you on Telegram when it looks risky. On each new order it checks the billing phone (with the billing country), the billing email and the customer IP. An order is risky when any score reaches your threshold, the phone is VOIP or risky, the email is disposable, or the IP is a proxy, VPN or Tor exit. The message shows the order number, total, name, the three scores and the flags. Other orders end the run. It helps store owners spot fraud before shipping. A failed check never alerts.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create a Header Auth credential named `FraudNova API`: header `Authorization`, value **`Bearer ` + space + your key** (key at https://fraudnova.com/dashboard/api-keys). New accounts get 25 free credits; each check costs 1 credit.\n2. Open **Settings** and set `risk_threshold` (default 75).\n3. Select your WooCommerce credential on the trigger. In the Telegram node pick your bot credential (create the bot with @BotFather) and set `chatId`.\n\n### Customization\nUse 85 to alert only on the worst orders. Replace the Telegram node with Slack, Discord or Email, connected to the `true` output of *Risky?*.\n\nTemplates and docs: https://github.com/dahleedam/fraudnova-examples/tree/main/examples/n8n",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -940,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## New order\nWooCommerce starts the run.\nSettings holds the threshold.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 7
      },
      "name": "Section: New order",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -340,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Check phone, email and IP\nThree checks, 3 credits per order.\nA failed check counts as not checked.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 660,
        "color": 7
      },
      "name": "Section: Check phone, email and IP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Alert on risk\nOnly risky orders reach Telegram.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 7
      },
      "name": "Section: Alert on risk",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        860,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Set your own chat id before activating",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 3
      },
      "name": "Warning: chat id",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1050,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "event": "order.created"
      },
      "name": "WooCommerce Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wooCommerceTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -300,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "wooCommerceApi": {
          "name": "WooCommerce account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "setting-1",
              "name": "risk_threshold",
              "value": 75,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -60,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://fraudnova.com/api/v1/check/phone",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "phone",
              "value": "={{ ($('WooCommerce Trigger').item.json.billing.phone || '').toString().replace(/[^0-9+\\-\\s()]/g, '') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "country",
              "value": "={{ $('WooCommerce Trigger').item.json.billing.country }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "name": "Check phone",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        180,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "FraudNova API"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://fraudnova.com/api/v1/check/email",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ $('WooCommerce Trigger').item.json.billing.email }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "name": "Check email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        420,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "FraudNova API"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://fraudnova.com/api/v1/check",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "ip",
              "value": "={{ $('WooCommerce Trigger').item.json.customer_ip_address }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "name": "Check IP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "FraudNova API"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Check phone').item.json.success === true && $('Check phone').item.json.data.fraud_score >= $('Settings').item.json.risk_threshold }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Check email').item.json.success === true && $('Check email').item.json.data.fraud_score >= $('Settings').item.json.risk_threshold }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-3",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Check IP').item.json.success === true && $('Check IP').item.json.data.fraud_score >= $('Settings').item.json.risk_threshold }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-4",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Check phone').item.json.success === true && ($('Check phone').item.json.data.VOIP === true || $('Check phone').item.json.data.risky === true) }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-5",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Check email').item.json.success === true && $('Check email').item.json.data.disposable === true }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-6",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Check IP').item.json.success === true && ($('Check IP').item.json.data.proxy === true || $('Check IP').item.json.data.vpn === true || $('Check IP').item.json.data.tor === true) }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Risky?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        900,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "=Risky WooCommerce order #{{ $('WooCommerce Trigger').item.json.number }}\nTotal: {{ $('WooCommerce Trigger').item.json.total }} {{ $('WooCommerce Trigger').item.json.currency }}\nCustomer: {{ ($('WooCommerce Trigger').item.json.billing.first_name || '').toString().replace(/[<>&]/g, '') }} {{ ($('WooCommerce Trigger').item.json.billing.last_name || '').toString().replace(/[<>&]/g, '') }}\nPhone score: {{ ($('Check phone').item.json.success === true) ? $('Check phone').item.json.data.fraud_score : 'n/a' }}\nEmail score: {{ ($('Check email').item.json.success === true) ? $('Check email').item.json.data.fraud_score : 'n/a' }}\nIP score: {{ ($('Check IP').item.json.success === true) ? $('Check IP').item.json.data.fraud_score : 'n/a' }}\nFlags: {{ [ ($('Check phone').item.json.success === true && $('Check phone').item.json.data.VOIP === true) ? 'VOIP phone' : '', ($('Check phone').item.json.success === true && $('Check phone').item.json.data.risky === true) ? 'risky phone' : '', ($('Check email').item.json.success === true && $('Check email').item.json.data.disposable === true) ? 'disposable email' : '', ($('Check IP').item.json.success === true && $('Check IP').item.json.data.proxy === true) ? 'proxy' : '', ($('Check IP').item.json.success === true && $('Check IP').item.json.data.vpn === true) ? 'VPN' : '', ($('Check IP').item.json.success === true && $('Check IP').item.json.data.tor === true) ? 'Tor' : '' ].filter(f => f).join(', ') || 'none (score only)' }}\nThreshold: {{ $('Settings').item.json.risk_threshold }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "parse_mode": "HTML"
        }
      },
      "name": "Telegram alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1160,
        -100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "WooCommerce Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Settings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Settings": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check phone",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check phone": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check email",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check email": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check IP",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check IP": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Risky?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Risky?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Telegram alert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
